        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fords_Prairie%2C_Washington",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1800s, travelers stopped at the Halfway House, an inn built right on the wagon trail.",
