      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fords_Prairie%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Wesley Everest Gravesite in Fords Prairie is listed on the National Register of Historic Places since 1991.",
